# Documentation routing

This repo holds **contributor dev docs only**. Public product and research docs live elsewhere.

## Write here

| Location | Content |
|----------|---------|
| `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `AGENTS.md` | Quick start, workflow, agent guardrails |
| `docs/contributing/` | Local setup, OSS dev deploy |
| `docs/electron-desktop/` | Paused desktop runbooks |

## Never write here

- `docs/architecture/` — ADRs, feature design, platform security docs
- `docs/research/` — research copy, marketing HTML
- `docs/*.html`, `docs/assets/` — legacy static site (removed)
- Orchestration plans or private strategy

## Public surfaces

- Product docs (including platform security designs) → [evaluchat/knowledge](https://github.com/evaluchat/knowledge) → knowledge.evaluchat.org
- Research methodology governance → [evaluchat/research](https://github.com/evaluchat/research) → research.evaluchat.org
- Private plans → knowledge-catalog OKF `evaluchat` bundle

Code + tests + `.env.example` stay in this repo; link to public OKF concepts via `sources:` URLs when documenting shipped behavior.
